MC SCRIPT — {{ event.name }}

OPENING
Good {{ time_of_day }}, everyone, and welcome to the {{ event.name }}!
I'd like to begin by acknowledging the Traditional Owners of the land on which we meet, and pay my respects to Elders past and present.
Today {{ teams|length }} teams from {{ houses|length }} houses will debate across {{ rounds|length }} rounds. Every debate earns points for your house, and so does good sportsmanship.

HOUSE ROLL CALL
When I call your house, make some noise — then please be ready to listen.
{% for h in houses -%}
- {{ h.name }}!
{% endfor %}
HOUSEKEEPING
- Your room and opponents are on the screen and on the noticeboard. If you can't find your room, ask a teacher in a lanyard.
- Speeches are timed. One knock means one minute left; two knocks mean time is up.
- Adjudicators' decisions are final. Thank your opponents and your adjudicator after every debate.
- If you feel unwell, tell the nearest teacher. First aid is in the staffroom.
{% for r in rounds %}
ROUND {{ r.number }}
{% if r.motion %}The motion for round {{ r.number }} is: "{{ r.motion }}".
I'll say that again: "{{ r.motion }}".{% else %}The motion for round {{ r.number }} will be on the screen in a moment.{% endif %}
You have {{ event.prep_minutes }} minutes to prepare. Affirmative teams, you open each debate. Please move to your rooms now.
{% if not loop.last %}
BETWEEN ROUNDS
Welcome back. Thank you to our adjudicators for getting the results in so quickly.
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
RESULTS
{% if ladder %}After {{ rounds|length }} rounds, our top three teams are:
{% for row in ladder[:3] -%}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ row.team }} ({{ row.house }}) — {{ row.wins|int }} wins
{% endfor %}{% endif %}
{% if house_totals %}And the house points for today, from fourth to first:
{% for h in house_totals|reverse -%}
{{ house_totals|length - loop.index0 }}. {{ h.name }} — {{ h.points }} points
{% endfor %}{% endif %}
THANK YOUS
Thank you to our adjudicators, timekeepers, house captains and every speaker today. Debating takes courage: well done.
